00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.640
Oh God...

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.880
So, the idea is that you're supposed to clean this, and...

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:42.440
That's it!

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:46.220
That's *Incoherent laughter* This is about the weirdest spectrum of games that I played

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.040
...But

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.000
Y' know...

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.220
